---
import { LINKS } from '@lib/constants';
---

<section
    class="section"
    aria-label="Terms of use"
>
    <div class="shell">
        <div
            class="prose"
            data-scroll
        >
            <p class="prose__updated">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-08-27">August 27, 2026</time></p>
            <h2>1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
            <p>By accessing empowheratx.com (the &ldquo;Site&rdquo;) or attending the EmpowHER Festival (the &ldquo;Event&rdquo;), you agree to these Terms of Use. Your use of the Site is also subject to our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site or attend the Event.</p>
            <h2>2. The Event</h2>
            <p>The Event is produced by Madewell Productions (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; &ldquo;our&rdquo;) and is scheduled for <time datetime="2027-04-17">April 17, 2027</time>, from <time datetime="2027-04-17T12:00-05:00">12PM</time> to <time datetime="2027-04-17T22:00-05:00">10PM</time> at the Austin Garden Stage at Inn Cahoots on East 6th Street in Austin, Texas. Event details &mdash; including dates, times, lineup, programming, and venue &mdash; are subject to change. The Event proceeds rain or shine, and programming may shift indoors; material changes will be communicated via the Site and our social channels.</p>
            <h2>3. Tickets, entry &amp; conduct</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Tickets are not yet on sale. When they become available, sales will be handled by a third-party ticketing provider, and refund, exchange, and transfer terms will be set at the point of sale.</li>
                <li>Merchandise is on sale through our online <a href="/store">store</a>. Payment is processed by Stripe on checkout pages hosted by Stripe; card details are entered there and never reach the Site. Buying merchandise does not include admission to the Event.</li>
                <li>Orders are fulfilled on demand and ship within the United States only. Your shipping address is collected by Stripe at checkout. Delivery dates shown at checkout or by the carrier are estimates, not guarantees, and risk of loss passes to you on delivery.</li>
                <li>If an item arrives damaged or does not match what you ordered, email us at <a href={`mailto:${LINKS.email}`}>{LINKS.email}</a> within 30 days of delivery and we will replace the item or refund it. Because items are made on demand, we do not otherwise accept returns or exchanges, including for a different size.</li>
                <li>Entry requirements &mdash; including any age policy, ID checks, and bag checks &mdash; will be posted ahead of the Event and enforced at the door.</li>
                <li>We reserve the right to refuse entry to, or remove, anyone whose behavior endangers others or violates venue rules, without refund.</li>
            </ul>
            <h2>4. Photography &amp; recording</h2>
            <p>The Event is photographed and filmed. By attending, you consent to appearing in photos and recordings that may be used for promotional purposes.</p>
            <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
            <p>All Site content &mdash; including the EmpowHER Festival name, logo, and artwork &mdash; is owned by Madewell Productions or its licensors and may not be reproduced without prior written permission.</p>
            <h2>6. Disclaimer &amp; limitation of liability</h2>
            <p>The Site and the Event are provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available.&rdquo; To the fullest extent permitted by law, we disclaim all warranties, express or implied, and are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the Site or attendance at the Event.</p>
            <h2>7. Governing law</h2>
            <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas, without regard to its conflict-of-law rules. Disputes will be resolved in the courts of Travis County, Texas.</p>
            <h2>8. Changes</h2>
            <p>We may update these terms from time to time; the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date above reflects the current version. Material changes will be announced on the Site.</p>
            <h2>9. Contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${LINKS.email}`}>{LINKS.email}</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
